          "author": "Saadia Faruqi",
          "description": "Ali Tahir is always ready for an adventure—whether it’s tackling a dinosaur-sized mistake, saving the day at a holiday party, or dealing with unexpected surprises. As a second grader with big ideas and even bigger determination, Ali learns that every problem has a solution—you just have to find it! \n\nFrom field trips to family celebrations to friendly competitions, this series brings humor, heart, and creativity to everyday challenges.  \n\nThis collection includes:  \nAli the Great and the Dinosaur Mistake (Book #1) \nAli the Great and the Eid Party Surprise (Book #2) \nAli the Great and the Paper Airplane Flop (Book #3) \nAli the Great and the Market Mishap (Book #4)",
